{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Meimetsu&quot; is an interactive experience set in a mysterious world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can influence the behavior of others by coming into contact with them, and your actions will lead to different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bThis is not a horror game.\u203b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions and choices will affect others,<br>and their reactions will shape your ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your behavior influences people.<br>You will be led to think about the meaning of this world, of people, and of yourself.<br>This world, and the people in it, want to understand <i>you</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Estimated playtime:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 to 60 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note: This game does not save your story progress.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u7121","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814230/c6cbe0ef8c6739687bdab135ab9a53e187c1b4d2.jpg"},{"name":"\u6551","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814230/5219f884c3a0b42edb50b0d06f805b07ecccc33c.jpg"},{"name":"\u52a9","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814230/9d26726fb8b24b5e2e1e976c687562b1273c636e.jpg"},{"name":"\u5831","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814230/fa20f1af1a94eebb7c52deeffa7fd46cab864f52.jpg"},{"name":"\u529b","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814230/1cf1f26197ebdb637669982e11b46fdacb083b35.jpg"},{"name":"\u97f3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814230/965743dd938e2abf9bc1bae3984b75c7101dd88b.jpg"},{"name":"\u771f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommuni